<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson launches new triple-mode phone.</title>
<headline>Ericsson launches new triple-mode phone.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group Ericsson on Thursday announced what it said was the world's first commercially available triple-mode digital phone.</p>
